  "description": "After working hard for revenge all his life, he became a lawyer with a 97% success rate. Now all that's left is to take revenge on that bastard, 'Smile', who killed his mother, but he ended up dying at the hands of that bastard... \n\n*\"Prosecutor Jang Hyun-Soo!\"\nWhat? He's possessed by that bastard Jang Hyun-Soo? Is it a twist of fate? No, is God giving him one more chance?\n\"Smile, I'll definitely get revenge on you!\"* \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
